        <h2>About this website</h2>
        <div class="flow has-gap-s pretty">
            <p>This site is not merely a self-promotion machine, but a self-invention machine. An <a href="https://notbadnotbad.substack.com/p/i-hope-someday-i-get-to-visit-your">island</a> to inhabit with my work, ideas, and the things I care about. Built for the long term, but malleable enough to change over time.</p>
            <p>I've taken steps to make this island as engaging and accessible as possible. I hope that you'll enjoy your stay.</p>
